OL,3,ARayner criticises visa rule proposals
OL,4,Aahead of Labour conference
OL,5,
OL,6,FUnder the proposals, most migrants
OL,7,Fwould have to wait 10 years to qualify
OL,8,Ffor residency - instead of the current
OL,9,Ffive - while foreign workers on health
OL,10,Fand social care visas would face a
OL,11,F15-year wait.
OL,13,FMahmood said the government would make
OL,14,Fa decision on the immigration overhaul
OL,15,Fby the end of the year.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
